WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.834
Welcome to Orbit. If things change. Our focus is First Conditional.

2
00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:14.417
Use if plus the present simple, followed by will plus a base verb, for a real future possibility.

3
00:00:14.417 --> 00:00:18.521
If you bring water, you will have something to drink.

4
00:00:18.521 --> 00:00:22.000
We will not start unless the teacher arrives.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.609
If the weather is good, we will meet at nine.

6
00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:35.007
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
